    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29640" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσχρηστ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>difficult position, awkward
				circumstances</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς δ. ἥκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.25.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.26.2
			</span></i>, al.; <i>distress</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.52
			</span></i> W., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mort.</u>
				26
			</span></i> (pl.); of things, <i>inconvenience, disadvantage</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.46.5
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.53.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρείας καὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.5.17
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεονέκτημα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.600a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράω</span>) <i>difficulty in obtaining loans,
				'tightness' of money</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				16.7.6
			</span></i>.</div>
